index 0000000000..6b7f0dd180
--- /dev/null
+++ b/projects/ROCKNIX/packages/network/raofflineproxy/patches/016-say-what-became-of-a-download.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,80 @@
+image_cache: say what became of a download, absent apart from transient
+
+download_static_image caught every exception and logged it at debug, so a
+caller learned nothing but that the file was not there. A caller that
+fetches a whole store's images -- ROCKNIX's image pass, which runs at the
+end of every scan and top-up -- could not tell an image the server does not
+have from one that did not come this time, and one badge the server never
+had (a 404) failed every pass for good.
