+# ---- audit #307, stream D ----
+echo "  D. audit #307 stream D: the offline-achievements service -- the control script, its helpers, the client's patches, the unit and the emulators' cheevos scripts (#307 PL-013, 055, 057, 058, 059, 060; #308's sweep)"
+# Each fix below was written after its case, and each case was seen to FAIL
+# against the scripts from before it; to watch them fire again:
+#
+#     BASE_REF=417dcd8610 tools/last-good-scripts-test --old
+#
+# (417dcd8610 is next where stream D was cut.) The ctl's cases run in section
+# t's sandbox -- its client from the sources cache with the patches applied,
+# its shims, its virtual clock and fixture store -- and SKIP with it when the
+# pinned client's tarball is not on this machine. The helpers' cases load the
